# Local working artifacts — run outputs, referee state, review pages,
# POC evidence, and design records that carry identities the committed
# tree never names (the no-customer-identifiers rule). ONE folder, one
# rule: if it must not ship, it lives under do-not-commit/.
do-not-commit/

# skill-written run artifacts (analyze-video state, visualize-metadata
# pages) — carry presigned URLs and deployment values, never committed
outputs/

# build artifacts (each workflow's build-deploy script owns its dist/)
dist/
build.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# GOTCHAS.md stays LOCAL by decision (2026-10-06): the sharp-edges
# journals carry customer/asset identities; they live beside the code
# on dev machines and in do-not-commit backups, never in the repo —
# history was purged of them before the first push.
GOTCHAS.md

# IDE / agent workspace config — local for now (how to share these
# across Claude Code and Kiro is an open decision; the skills
# themselves are committed under media-toolkit-gateway/skills/)
.claude/
.kiro/
.mcp.json
.gateway-mcp-headers.sh
gateway_headers.*

.DS_Store
